      55.25,
      494.06,
      549.78,
      635.13
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby noti\ufb01 ed that the Annual Sri Maha Bodhiraja Procession of Sri Shasanalankararama Ancient Temple in the Grama Niladhari Division of Udugama in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Nagoda, District of Galle, Southern Province, will be held from 6th of March 2024 to 12th of March 2024 as per the regulations published in the Extraordinary Gazette No: 1956/11 dated 01.03.2016 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka under Section 2 of the Pilgrimages Ordinance (Cap.175). S\u0d81\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a W\u0d7e\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7a\u0d8c\u0d82\u0d87\u0d80\u0d81\u0d7e, District Secretary/Government Agent, Administrative District, Galle. At the District Secretariat, Galle. 06th February 2024.",
